day_03_intro
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/main_road_placeholder.jpg" fade="0.0"]
Narrator:  The enormous amount of effort Catherine made for the last 2 days worsened her condition.
Narrator: She coughs more and more. She knows that if she continues like that, her days might come even sooner.
Narrator: Doomed either way, she decides to continue. But the atmosphere in the town feels heavier that the days before.
